# This package is type-check tooling only: package.js declares no Npm.depends, so nothing here
# ever ships. mongodb (pulled in transitively by @types/meteor for its Mongo types) declares
# @aws-sdk/credential-providers as an OPTIONAL dependency for AWS IAM auth, and npm installs
# optional deps by default - which added 23 AWS SDK / smithy packages we will never execute.
# Omitting them keeps the supply-chain surface to what the type-check actually reads.
omit=optional
